WEBVTT

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.490
The months that pass within my dreams

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:23.410
I cast aside my worldly desires 
along with my black hair

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:29.670
If I turn around, the stories of the 
past would appear before my eyes

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.130
In a drunken haze, I laugh at the world

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:39.010
Shangri-la is nowhere to be found

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:44.810
No one knows the love of the spring wind

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:54.030
The beginning and the 
end repeat over and over

00:00:54.610 --> 00:01:01.990
Trading places, they bloom then wilt

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:05.830
In January, I pick a flower with no petals

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:13.170
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:17.680
In March, the peach blossoms bloom

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:24.640
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.690
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:32.780
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:40.990
<b>2: Ryuukosan</b>

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:53.170
<i>This is the legendary secluded mountain</i>

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:55.740
<i>where countless hermits have trained,</i>

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.510
<i>famous even among the outsiders...</i>

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.130
<i>Ryuukosan?</i>

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:08.690
It's not quite what I had imagined.

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:11.090
It's a pretty lively place.

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:12.890
Looks like the entrance is over there.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:17.860
There's an entry fee?

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:20.300
And it's 260 yuan per person?

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:21.660
What a rip-off.

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:25.510
Don't be so angry.

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:29.860
Ryuukosan is now a major tourist 
spot managed by the government.

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:33.650
The Tenshifu could never manage 
such a massive plot of land.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:37.060
The legendary Ryuukosan 
is a tourist site, huh?

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:40.660
Hey, 260 yuan is nothing.

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:44.300
The entry fee to our Butousan is even worse.

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:45.800
Huh?

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:49.550
Oh, excuse me. I'm Ouya of the Butou Sect.

00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:50.430
Who are you?

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:53.060
I'm Chou Soran. Nice to meet you.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:55.420
Chou Soran, huh?

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:01.390
Ah! You have the palm of a ruler!

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:04.120
Great news, young lady.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.620
You'll live to a ripe old age.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.530
I do feel like I've been alive forever.

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.960
Huh?

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:15.100
Well, in any case, you're 
worthy of possessing this.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:19.000
Hidden treasure of the heavens, 
the rosary of Akarurigyoku!

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:23.640
My master acquired this valuable artifact 
after battling a fire-breathing kirin

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.430
ten thousand times!

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:29.940
I wish I could ask for 98,000 yuan, 
but I'm letting it go for a mere 9,800!

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:32.220
No, I'd be willing to let you have it 
for the low, low price of 1,980—

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:32.970
I want it! Gimme, gimme!

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:33.480
Wait a minute!

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.340
Houhou, don't be deceived by his nonsense!

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:38.660
But it came from a fire-breathing kirin!

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:39.900
A kirin!

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:40.480
Those don't exist!

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:42.180
But I want it!

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:45.570
It's only 1,980! 1,980 yuan!

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:47.580
Chou Soran, why did you decide to 
participate in the Raten Taishou?

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.750
You still can't buy it!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.250
Huh?

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.760
Ouya-san, are you, too?

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:54.620
Then you must know who I am.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:58.910
The Tenshifu know something 
about my grandpa.

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:03.270
If I win this tournament, 
I can meet the Tenshi.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:07.240
Then I can get him to tell me all 
kinds of things about my grandpa.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.300
Meet the Tenshi?

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:11.750
Well, that's easy.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:12.560
Really?

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.800
Follow me.

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:17.420
I'll be right back.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:19.890
I'll even throw in this cool hat and sword!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.300
Wow!

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:20.530
Houhou, that's enough!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.860
Take a look. The Tenshi's over there.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.530
Tenshi, smile, please.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:30.130
Yeah.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.680
Uh...

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:34.650
Being the Tenshi is hard work.

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:37.760
Someone important must be visiting again.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:37.990
That's all for today's interview.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.500
Thank you, Tenshi.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:43.580
See you later.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:44.680
Tenshi!

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.610
I am Ouya of the Butou Sect.

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:50.260
I've brought a friend with me today.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:55.020
Ah, Ouya. I'm glad you 
seem to be doing well.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:00.050
Are you Chou Soran?

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.180
Um...

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:05.330
You can call me "Master."

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:08.690
Your grandfather and I 
were fellow apprentices.

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:12.950
You're like a grandson to me.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:16.390
M-Master!

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:25.340
Reigyoku, I need to speak with Soran.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:28.120
Could you entertain our guests?

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:29.890
Certainly.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:35.230
Shall we go someplace else?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.770
It's Chou Reigyoku-sama!

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.880
He's so hot!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:55.480
Uh...

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:03.090
U-Um, Master?

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:07.170
Soran, I know what you want to ask.

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:11.920
Your grandfather's true name was Chou Kaigi.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:14.770
Ch-Chou Kaigi?

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:20.390
Chou Shakurin was a false name 
he used to escape harm.

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:23.350
You'd learn nothing by trying 
to research that name.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:29.350
But this is all I can tell you for now.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:34.590
I'll tell you the rest once you 
earn the right to succeed me.

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:39.810
Why? If you tell me now, I won't 
have to fight in the Raten Taishou!

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:42.290
I just want to know the truth.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.830
I don't actually want to fight any—

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:45.870
Soran.

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:51.480
I understand what you're saying, 
but I can't right now.

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:59.880
What happened to Chou Kaigi is closely 
related to the Tenshi succession system.

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:07.060
How long are they going to talk?

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:09.570
Hey, you can't smoke here.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:17.480
<i>How is he related to the 
Tenshi succession system?</i>

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:18.440
Hey, Soran.

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:21.510
What are you doing? Let's go.

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:23.750
Yeah, right.

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:26.600
Hey, where's Ouya-san?

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.030
He headed toward the tournament space.

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:30.560
We'd better hurry, too.

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:31.510
Got it.

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:37.300
Man, there isn't even a path!

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:38.630
Deal with it.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:42.410
Tourists don't come back here, 
so it's not maintained.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.100
There's no bridge...

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:50.090
I've been waiting for you.

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:52.490
The tournament will take place 
on the other side of this ravine.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.480
Don't worry.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:58.740
We've strung a rope across it for those 
who have no other means of crossing.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.290
Seriously?

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:04.130
The Tenshifu sure do 
love their stupid games.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:07.860
Darling, it's hot. Make sure you 
blow on it before you eat it.

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:10.130
God, you're always hungry.

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:13.950
Well, if it isn't Tou Yuufuku and Tou Yuusai.

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:16.420
What a surprise to see you brothers here.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:19.870
I'm not Tou Yuufuku. I'm Smith.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:21.600
Smith, my ass.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:24.330
You think you're so hot just because 
you studied abroad for a bit.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:26.830
Have you forgotten your own name?

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:31.650
Then I'm going home.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.850
I never wanted to come, anyway.

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:36.330
Fine, fine, Yuufuku.

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:38.900
Come on, let's go.

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:42.690
Mom and Dad are waiting for us 
to make a name for ourselves.

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:44.560
I love you, darling.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:46.000
Hold on tight!

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.300
Jo San, Jo Yon!

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.230
We'll be waiting!

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:08.140
What?

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:10.910
Dad's coming!

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:16.600
Unbelievable.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:20.740
How many times do I have to tell 
him not to throw our daughter?

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.880
<i>I'm supposed to fight these monsters?</i>

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.560
Go ahead.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:40.640
I don't care if this looks lame.

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:45.650
I need to cross this ravine first.

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:48.470
Outta the way!

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:50.990
Careful, there!

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:52.540
Watch out, Hou-nee!

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:57.320
I'm flying.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.980
I'm Ja Seiryan from Senseishou.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:03.980
Those uniforms...

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:06.740
You're with the Express Delivery Company.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.790
What a coincidence.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:12.250
I heard one of you took care of my brother.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:17.300
Supposedly it was a slovenly-looking 
person with long, disheveled hair.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.960
Someone who looked exactly like this woman.

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.250
You know them?

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:25.660
What are you planning to do to Hou-nee?

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:32.010
I made it.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:37.720
My brother may be a piece of trash, 
but we're siblings who share the same blood.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:40.660
Prepare yourself, Fuu Houhou.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:48.370
Good grief.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:51.550
You got yourself caught up in 
some trouble, Houhou-chan.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:03.010
This crowd...

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:05.070
It's like an amusement park.

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:07.720
Hey, Express Delivery Company!
Long time no see!

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:09.680
I'm Fuu Shinton of the Tengekai.

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:12.700
You know, the small fry who 
was terrified of Houhou.

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:14.890
Don't call yourself that.

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:17.310
Saen-san, are you participating, too?

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:21.580
Of course. Shinton and
I are both participating.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.560
Saen-san's not coming with you?

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:28.830
She's meeting a friend.

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:34.320
I forgot to mention that we're 
only here because of our dad.

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:38.830
We're not particularly interested in the 
Tenshi or the Tsuutenroku, so don't worry.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:41.540
You're the star this time, Chou Soran.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:44.260
All the outsiders are talking about you.

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:49.010
Even though you haven't trained at Ryuukosan, 
you've mastered Kinkouju and Raihou.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:52.120
You're even the successor 
of the kitaigen style.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:54.340
Everyone's eyes are on you.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:59.910
Those guys we just passed 
are Bouzan's apprentices.

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:01.150
And...

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.810
That smiling man is Shoushou.

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:05.830
Despite how he looks, he has a black heart.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.050
She's Haku Shiishe.

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:13.450
She's a real miser, so you'll want to 
pay her off when you fight her.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:15.640
That's Tsuu Kinka.

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:19.290
She's not much of a fighter, but she's sharp.

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:22.690
You'll come up against her eventually.

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:25.310
It's pretty nice of you 
to tell me all of this.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:29.860
My dad told me to help you out.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:33.940
He really seems to like you.

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:38.310
And he still hasn't given up 
on you marrying my sister.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:43.520
Anyway, your greatest 
opponents are those two.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:49.310
I've heard a lot about you, 
Reigyoku the shinjin.

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:50.960
It's an honor to meet you.

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.790
Not at all, Shokatsu-sensei.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:56.160
I am a simple country priest.

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:58.660
I don't deserve your respect.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:00.230
How modest of you.

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:03.720
I hope we have the opportunity 
to fight one another.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.050
As do I.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:08.510
I look forward to seeing the secret arts 
of the Shokatsu family passed down

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:10.470
since the Marquess Wu of Wei.

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:13.690
Reigyoku-sama!

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:20.110
Shokatsu-sensei, I appreciate your attention,

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:24.530
but there are powerful fighters like the 
dragon and tiger hiding at Ryuukosan right now.

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:30.520
It won't be long before you meet 
someone far greater than myself.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.500
I look forward to that.

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.090
It's good to see you again, Reigyoku-sama.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:38.110
Fuu Shinton, was it?

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:39.750
I'm glad you seem to be doing well.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:43.000
We meet again, Reigyoku-sama.

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:48.040
Shokatsu-sensei, let me show 
you around the temple.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.080
I appreciate it.

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:51.630
Hey, wait!

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:54.990
Why are you ignoring me? Reigyoku!

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:54.820
Hey, hey! Calm down!

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:58.230
Jeez, what did I ever do to him?

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:01.340
Anyway, you're amazing.

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.560
You know so much about outsiders.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:09.740
I suck at kung fu, but I'm confident 
in my ability to gather information.

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:13.430
Your information is worth less than shit.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:21.960
There's no point in gathering information 
everybody knows, white head.

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:24.550
You're here, too?

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:25.560
You know him?

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:26.640
Sorta.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:29.130
Hey, Zouryuu. If that's how you feel,

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:32.550
you must have information on the 
guy standing next to me, right?

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:37.400
I told you before, I only gather 
information on major players.

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:40.050
I'm not interested in rabble.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:41.920
Then this should surprise you.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:43.740
This is Chou Soran!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.200
Chou Soran?

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:46.040
Impossible!

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.650
That's the successor to the kitaigen style?

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:49.730
Chou Soran?

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.830
You shouldn't have said that.

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:53.650
So you're the great Chou Soran?

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:56.570
I didn't think you'd be so plain-looking.

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:59.400
This is an Express Delivery uniform...

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:03.740
Which means she's your friend?

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:05.710
Will you be participating together?

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:09.600
I didn't come to become the Tenshi.

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:12.250
He's the one who will 
become the next Tenshi.

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:16.930
My job is to bury everyone 
who gets in his way.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.050
What?!

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:23.210
Hou-nee, please, just... don't say anything!

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:25.470
You want me to kill them 
without saying anything?

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:26.900
No killing!

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:32.620
The young are so lively.

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:36.460
It makes me feel young again.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.410
Thank you for waiting, everyone.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:42.980
I won't waste your time talking.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:45.580
I know what you hope for and expect.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:52.660
The selection tournament will now begin.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.970
Participants, please take turns drawings lots

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:00.600
to determine your opponent 
and the order of competition.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:07.950
Ah, so that's Chou Soran.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:11.430
He doesn't look much like Kaigi.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.410
Good grief.

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:20.980
If I'd found Kaigi then, this 
wouldn't have happened to me...

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:23.500
Don't say that, Shinchuu.

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:26.610
It was all my fault.

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:32.300
I shouldn't have sent you 
to look for Kaigi alone.

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:37.430
Then you never would've 
lost all your kung fu...

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:45.600
Second White Tiger, huh?

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:49.460
The zodiac sign on your paper determines 
the order in which you will fight.

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:53.340
The animal determines your opponent.

00:16:53.730 --> 00:16:58.450
Those with the same animal written on their 
papers will fight against each other.

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:02.440
You will compete in a knockout 
stage in groups of four.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:07.230
Only the sole victor will 
move on to the next stage.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.400
I got second White Tiger.

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:13.040
I got third Black Tortoise.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.590
I'm glad we didn't get each other.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:16.440
Yeah.

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:19.630
But Hou-nee's up first...

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:21.470
Combatants, enter!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:27.150
This isn't good.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:29.080
Is her opponent that strong?

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.980
Those three are a team.

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:34.520
They call them the Touen 
Brothers of Tenshin.

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:37.200
So it's three against one.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:41.110
Just so you know, we're not cheating.

00:17:41.110 --> 00:17:45.290
It's pure coincidence that the three 
of us ended up in the same group.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:49.080
Yeah. It's what you'd call fate.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:52.150
Damn it, this puts Hou-nee 
at a huge disadvantage.

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:53.950
Combatants, enter!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:59.170
The match will now begin!

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:04.030
Whoa, whoa! This little girl is our opponent?

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:05.660
Now, don't be scared.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:08.860
We'll be gentle, okay?

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:13.290
H-Houhou-neesan?!

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:16.630
Wh-What are you doing here, Houhou-neesan?

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:18.450
I came to bury you.

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:21.400
Actually, who are you?

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.390
I'm Ryuuhou.

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:25.760
I'm Kan Reiji.

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:27.080
I'm Chousai.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:31.480
Don't you remember? When we 
took our pranks too far,

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.800
you disciplined us with your whip of love.

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:38.110
I remember now.

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:40.800
You're still alive.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.710
Our toughness is our greatest strength.

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:46.990
I can't believe we're meeting here, though...

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.510
Hey, you!

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:50.350
Are you going to fight or not?

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:52.030
Of course not!

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:54.460
She's our sister!

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:56.310
Then what will you do?

00:18:59.190 --> 00:19:01.190
We admit defeat!

00:19:01.190 --> 00:19:02.700
We lose!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.300
Houhou-neesan has achieved total victory!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:10.600
So, how's Jo Yon doing?

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:11.410
Go see for yourselves.

00:19:11.890 --> 00:19:15.120
Houhou-neesan, you're as curt as always.

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:19.030
<i>I shouldn't have worried.</i>

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:35.460
Impressive as always, shinjin Reigyoku.

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:37.380
We don't stand a chance against him.

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.020
I-I surrender.

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.520
Very good.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:43.370
Chou Reigyoku wins!

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:46.830
They were completely ineffective, 
even though they teamed up against him.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.390
He's as strong as ever.

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:51.830
And he's popular.

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:58.370
<i>So the other three will team 
up against any favorites.</i>

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:01.130
<i>I might be in trouble.</i>

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:03.190
<i>Isn't there anything I can do?</i>

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:13.760
Sis, how did your match go?

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:16.130
Pathetic.

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:18.350
They were so weak, 
it wasn't even a warm up.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:22.230
I see. Houhou made it through 
the first round, too.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:24.620
I'm sure she struggled.

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:27.960
The Raten Taishou isn't that easy.

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.590
Struggled?

00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:32.550
Her opponents took one look 
at her and surrendered.

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:36.800
The second White Tiger 
match will begin shortly.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:39.530
That's Chou Soran's match.

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:41.660
Let's check it out.

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:56.760
That Chou Soran brat got scared and ran.

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:58.100
He couldn't have.

00:20:58.100 --> 00:21:00.490
He's the successor of the kitaigen style.

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:03.950
Remember, follow the plan.

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:05.630
We know.

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:08.430
First we'll defeat Chou Soran together.

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:10.760
We'll settle things between us after that.

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:12.300
He's here.

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:20.420
Thirty years east of the river,

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:24.170
thirty years west of the river.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:27.540
Life has its ups and downs.

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:33.090
Now is the time to avenge my grandfather.

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:40.270
I am the successor to the secret 
arts of the kitaigen style:

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:42.530
Chou Soran!

